# Dockerfile-scoped ignore (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# in preference to a repo-wide `.dockerignore`). The image installs
# rigortype from RubyGems and copies nothing from the build context,
# so keeping the context empty makes `docker build` fast.
#
# This lives next to `Dockerfile` rather than as a top-level
# `.dockerignore` on purpose: a repo-wide `.dockerignore` is inherited
# by external tools that embed the rigor source via BuildKit
# `--build-context`, which would hand them a 2-byte (empty) context and
# break their build. Scoping it to this Dockerfile keeps rigor's own
# image build identical while leaving downstream source consumers
# unaffected.
*
